 local tourism.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/ramsgates-historic-clock-house-restored-a-journey-back-in-time-to-the-towns-unique-meridian/articleshow/136134128.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/ramsgates-historic-clock-house-restored-a-journey-back-in-time-to-the-towns-unique-meridian/articleshow/136134128.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-25T17:01:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136134476,imgsize-1748928.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[A non-venomous snake that does not constrict its prey can still kill with its bite]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136149907.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Recent studies on Drymarchon snakes reveal their impressive biting ability, which they utilize to capture prey with remarkable efficiency. Unlike typical assumptions about non-venomous species, these snakes can exert bite pressures surpassing those of their constrictor counterparts. The research highlights how their jaw anatomy facilitates this concentrated force, emphasizing that their success also hinges on maintaining grip post-bite.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/wildlife/a-non-venomous-snake-that-does-not-constrict-its-prey-can-still-kill-with-its-bite-a-study-of-three-drymarchon-species-found-their-jaws-generate-tissue-damaging-pressure-greater-than-constriction-by-similarly-sized-snakes/articleshow/136149907.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/wildlife/a-non-venomous-snake-that-does-not-constrict-its-prey-can-still-kill-with-its-bite-a-study-of-three-drymarchon-species-found-their-jaws-generate-tissue-damaging-pressure-greater-than-constriction-by-similarly-sized-snakes/articleshow/136149907.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-25T17:01:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136150531,imgsize-153198.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Mortgage-Free Home: Army Veteran’s Family Gets New Home; construction begins Nov 20]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136123086.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[At a live concert, army veteran Michael King received a heartwarming surprise—a mortgage-free, custom-built home for him and his family. This remarkable announcement, brought forth by Belman Homes and Operation Finally Home, occurred during a Craig Morgan performance. King's military service has resulted in health challenges, and this initiative seeks to ensure lasting stability for veterans.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-wisconsin-army-veteran-went-to-a-craig-morgan-concert-expecting-a-night-of-music-instead-michael-king-and-his-family-learned-they-would-receive-a-new-mortgage-free-home-with-a-groundbreaking-planned-the-next-day/articleshow/136123086.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-wisconsin-army-veteran-went-to-a-craig-morgan-concert-expecting-a-night-of-music-instead-michael-king-and-his-family-learned-they-would-receive-a-new-mortgage-free-home-with-a-groundbreaking-planned-the-next-day/articleshow/136123086.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-25T17:01:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136123137,imgsize-804051.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[3 dead, 23 trapped after flood hits illegal gold mine in Indonesia]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="marg